ethics complaints against Marjorie Taylor Greene.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.800
She's accused of unethical and illegal&nbsp;
spending by her Save America Stop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:52.400
Socialism leadership PAC. One complaint&nbsp;
was filed with the House's ethics body,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:58.560
